From ab323546f64547b92fad706ef762632dc7e4289b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Selman Trabzon <selman.trbzon@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:28:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat: app mode, foreseerr's web ui in the window between
 plays

On Linux the receiver build is now the Foreseerr app: a WebKitGTK view over
the Flutter view loads Foreseerr from its server and hands play links to the
player directly. The player takes the window while something plays, then
Foreseerr comes back, windowed again if it was. The page keeps its own
cookies and storage, so Foreseerr stays signed in. First run asks for the
address.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
